<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><I>Change&nbsp;of&nbsp;Officer and Directors</I></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Effective September 10, 2026, Mr. Jiancong
Huang resigned as a&nbsp;director&nbsp;and the Chairman&nbsp;of&nbsp;the board&nbsp;of&nbsp;directors (the &ldquo;Board&rdquo;)&nbsp;of&nbsp;ZK
International Group Co., Ltd. (the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;). The resignation&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mr. Huang was not a result&nbsp;of&nbsp;any disagreement
with the Company on any matter related to the operations, policies, or practices&nbsp;of&nbsp;the Company.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Effective September 10, 2026, Ms. Xiaofen Jin
resigned as the Chief Financial Officer&nbsp;of&nbsp;Company. The resignation&nbsp;of&nbsp;Ms. Jin was not a result&nbsp;of&nbsp;any disagreement
with the Company on any matter related to the operations, policies, or practices&nbsp;of&nbsp;the Company.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Effective September 10, 2026, Mr. Ruihong Ma,
was elected as the Chairman of the Board&nbsp;and the Chief Financial Officer by the remaining members&nbsp;of&nbsp;the Board to fill
the vacancies resulting from the resignations&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mr. Huang and Ms. Jin.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

